{
  "uid": "pp-api-usage",
  "title": "API usage - requests to upstream providers",
  "description": "Exact number of HTTP requests sent to USGS, NOAA SWPC and Open-Meteo, and Open-Meteo quota usage.",
  "tags": [
    "planet-pulse",
    "platform",
    "api"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "1h"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Planet Pulse",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "planet-pulse"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n#### How many requests do we really send?\nEvery request leaves a sample behind, so nothing here is estimated:\n**1 scrape** of `job=\"upstream\"` (json-exporter) = 1 request · **1 probe** of `job=\"synthetics\"` (Alloy blackbox) = 1 request ·\n**1 query** of the Infinity datasource (SWPC bulletins, on dashboard load) = 1 request.\nRules: `prometheus/rules/api-usage.yml`.\n\n| Provider | Free-tier limit | Alerts |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Open-Meteo** | 10 000 / day · 5 000 / hour · 600 / minute (per IP, non-commercial) | `UpstreamApiQuotaNearlyExhausted` > 80 % · `UpstreamRateLimited` on HTTP 429 |\n| USGS, NOAA SWPC | no published limit, \"reasonable use\" | – |\n"
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Open-Meteo - daily quota used",
      "description": "Requests in the last 24 h / 10 000. At 100 % Open-Meteo answers HTTP 429.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.6
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "upstream:api_quota_usage:ratio{provider=\"openmeteo\", window=\"1d\"}",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
